Description: Visual Pinball X - Pinball simulator
 Visual Pinball X is an open source pinball table editor and simulator.
 It simulates pinball table physics and renders the table with OpenGL.
 Features include:
  - Pinball table physics simulation
  - Multiple rendering backends (OpenGL, bgfx)
  - VR/XR support with OpenXR
  - Plugin system for DMD, backglass, AI assistant, and other displays
  - Table logic controlled via Visual Basic Script
  - Emulation of real pinball machines via PinMAME
  - AI Assistant plugin for table generation and analysis
 .
 This package includes the main application, necessary libraries,
 and the IA Assistant plugin for AI-powered table creation.
 .
 Tables are available from community repositories.

Package: vpinball-common
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, libcurl4, nlohmann-json3
Description: Common files for Visual Pinball X
 Architecture-independent files for Visual Pinball X, including:
  - Documentation including IA Assistant plugin guide
  - Default configuration files for AI providers
  - Desktop integration files
  - Example configurations for AI API keys

